'''Baboons''' are a monster summoned by [[Ba-Ba]] in the [[Tombs of Amascut]]. They attack the sarcophagi in the area; if left unchecked, the open sarcophagi will discharge energy blasts that crash down into the fight area.

If the "Jungle Japes" invocation is also enabled, the baboons will drop two [[banana peel]]s on the floor upon death. If a peel is stepped or run over, the player takes small amounts of damage and is left stunned for 3 seconds.

